@ProductApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5068

### Get All Products
GET {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/product
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Product By Id
GET {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Add Product
POST {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mobile",
  "price": 15000
}

###

### Update Product
PUT {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 60000
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/product/1

###